Package: mediation.test
Title: More Powerful Tests of the Composite Null Hypothesis Arising in Mediation Analysis
Version: 1.2.5
Date: 2025-07-14
Authors@R: c(
    person("Antoine", "Chambaz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "antoine.chambaz@u-paris.fr"),
    person("Caleb", "Miles", role = "aut",
           email = "cm3825@cumc.columbia.edu"))
Description: Implements minimax and Bayes-risk tests for the product-null
    hypothesis encountered in mediation analysis, together with multiple-testing
    variants and utilities for constructing rejection-probability maps.
